Z||000015||Monkeyman||12-26-1999||07:42 PM||||I already bragged about what I got, but I'm more than happy to brag again.  I got a new DVD player (plus a certificate for 15 free movie rentals), a deposit on an '85 GT, a huge Craftsman tool chest, a bunch of new tools to put in same, a jigsaw, a digital camera (WOW), a jacket, money, and 7 (!!!!!!) new babies (monkeys for those of you who don't know me)!!!!!!  I haven't had a Christmas like this in a long time.  Also, I got a parts car (well, in a couple of months) and my father-in-law found an '86 coupe with a blown motor and a cherry body for $100!!!  I feel kinda bad, because all I got for my wife (most of this stuff came from her) was a lousy diamond ring.  I gotta make it up to her.||||reg||1
